SYMBOL Digital\dflop 848 576 R0
SYMATTR InstName A1
TEXT 32 864 Left 2 !.ic V(a)=0 V(b)=0
TEXT 32 896 Left 2 !.tran 0 4.2m 0
TEXT 32 928 Left 2 !.meas TRAN vin AVG V(in) FROM 0.2m TO 4.2m
TEXT 32 960 Left 2 !.meas TRAN duty AVG V(q) FROM 0.2m TO 4.2m
TEXT 32 992 Left 2 !.meas TRAN code PARAM 2*duty-1
TEXT 32 1024 Left 2 !.meas TRAN vb_pk MAX abs(V(b)) FROM 0.2m TO 4.2m
TEXT 32 1072 Left 2 ;SPICA sample: continuous-time 2nd-order sigma-delta ADC (CIFB, NRZ DAC), 1 MHz clock.
TEXT 32 1104 Left 2 ;code = 2*duty-1 is the decimated (boxcar) output; ideal code = vin/Vref.
TEXT 32 1136 Left 2 ;Scatter & TF: X=vin, Y=code, theory x -> gain error from Vref and R1/R2, offset from Vos (gauss).
TEXT 32 1168 Left 2 ;B1/B2 are op-amps with 1e5 gain and +-10 V rails; .ic starts both integrators at 0 V.
